<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xerox raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it had raised its rating on Xerox Corp to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage maintained Xerox's rating of long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The document processing and copier company's shares closed at 52 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
